<title>UK: LME re-elects chairman, vice chairman for 1997.</title>
<headline>LME re-elects chairman, vice chairman for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of the London Metal Exchange (LME) re-elected Raj Bagri and Ralph Kestenbaum to the posts of chairman and vice chairman respectively of the LME for 1997, the LME said in a notice.</p>
<p>The re-elections took place at the board meeting held on December 11.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8057</p>
